<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date Basis</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Billing date; missing invoice records fall back to created date when billing date is unavailable.</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Detail Basis</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Same invoice records and filters as the webpage, including NotAssigned and SAP-only invoices under Other.</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Amount Basis</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">InvoiceAmount (Net, AUD) uses SAP VBRK.NETWR with S1/AB cancellations deducted. Negative cancellation rows are intentional; removing them overstates revenue.</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Missing Invoice Details Rule</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Create invoice tickets missing an invoice number or price remain in the order count with zero invoice amount.</Data></Cell></Row>
